      "title": "Coefficient generator and system math boundary",
      "contract": {
        "entries": 32769,
        "step": "RN64(512 / ratio)",
        "cutoff": "ratio<1 ? RN64(ratio*0.5) : 0.5",
        "beta_bits": "0x4021eb851eb851ec",
        "beta_decimal": 8.96,
        "half_beta_bits": "0x4011eb851eb851ec",
        "epsilon_bits": "0x3b92e3b40a0e9b4f",
        "series": "term=sum=index=1; do { q=RN64(half/index); index=RN64(index+1); q=RN64(q*q); term=RN64(term*q); sum=RN64(sum+term); } while(term>=RN64(sum*epsilon))",
        "sinc": "h[0]=1; increment=RN64(RN64(RN64(cutoff+cutoff)*piBits400921fb54442d18)*2^-9); h[i]=RN64(system_sin(RN64(i*increment))/RN64(i*increment)), i1..32768. Native pair invokes second index before first.",
        "window": "r=RN64(i*2^-15); radial=FSQRT(FMA(-r,r,1)); half=RN64(RN64(radial*beta)*0.5); h[i]=RN64(h[i]*RN64(series(half)*RN64(1/series(halfBeta))))",
        "normalization": "sum is ordered RN64 addition h[512],h[1024],...,h[32768]; scale=RN64(1/FMA(sum,2,1)); each h[i]=RN64(h[i]*scale).",
        "difference": "d[i]=RN64(h[i+1]-h[i]), i0..32767; d[32768]=-h[32768]",
        "math_boundary": "Exact original indirect symbol resolves to _sin. Reconstruction uses host C sin; neither target execution nor equivalence of every OS/libm implementation has been demonstrated.",
        "early_label_correction": "An early message called beta8.6. Original MOVKs and implementation constants decode8.96; candidate always used original bits. Corrected before oracle validation or sealing."
